  "document": "Regina Richards\nRegina Richards (born 1961), best known by her stage name Regina, is an American pop music singer born in Brooklyn, New York. She is best known for her hit song \"Baby Love,\" which reached Number 10 on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100 in 1986. \"Baby Love\" was her only song to chart on the Hot 100, making her a one hit wonder. The song also reached #50 on the UK Singles Chart that same year."
